    "body": "fix on issue/4031-tool-hand · PR #4103 · pinned by cutter_hand (app and tools), tool_library, tap_hand · merges when reviewed\n\nSteps 1, 2 and 5 as scoped: the tool's `cutter_hand` (right M3, left M4, separate from `thread_hand`); the tool gate refuses a left-hand cutter by name for each operation on a post that cannot reverse (haas, tormach, doosan-dnm, grbl, grblhal, carvera, heidenhain, heidenhain-klartext) - at creation and as the operation's after-state, so generation, the post, the tree and the page all refuse; the project file steps to v83 and a `.camtools` library with a left-hand cutter steps to version 7.\n\nThe gate pins: a left-hand cutter generates and posts unchanged on the Fanuc post, and writes no NC file on Haas. Steps 3 and 4 are filed as #4102.\n",
